#: ../../source/docs/using-python-scripts-in-mission-planner.rst:5
#: 35b567f8715e4d9e88d44810298fb7c4
msgid "Using Python Scripts in Mission Planner"
msgstr "在 Mission Planner 中使用 Python 脚本"

#: ../../source/docs/using-python-scripts-in-mission-planner.rst:7
#: ca3a84a2f6354378af3907abfa2ee22f
msgid ""
"One of the cool features of the Mission Planner is that it can run Python "
"scripts, which is an easy way to extend the functionality of the program "
"beyond its built-in functions. It can also enable integration easily with "
"other dlls and modules far beyond the original scope of the Mission Planner."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner 的一项实用功能是可以运行 Python 脚本，这是一种在内置功能之外扩展程序功能的简便方式。它还可以轻松实现与其他 "
"dll 及模块的集成，远超 Mission Planner 原有的功能范围。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-python-scripts-in-mission-planner.rst:14
#: 5cdbc0b970694721b3c34d367ee8e15c
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/using-python-scripts-in-mission-planner.rst:16
#: 1606982fdf394c6eb1068a3ae3af7215
msgid ""
"You can easily program your UAV to do anything, from robotic acrobatics to "
"just script-driven missions. Python 2.x is currently supported, up to 2.7 "
"(Mission Planner uses an implementation of `IronPython "
"<http://ironpython.codeplex.com/>`__ internally)"
msgstr ""
"您可以轻松编程让 UAV 执行任何操作，从机器人特技飞行到脚本驱动的任务均可实现。目前支持 Python 2.x，最高支持 2.7 版本（Mission"
" Planner 内部使用 `IronPython <http://ironpython.codeplex.com/>`__ 的实现）。"

